---
alt: "Santashop admin app data and function flow"
---
sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Santashop admin app data and function flow
    accDescr: Main admin UI services, callable functions, Firestore collections, and stats documents involved in the admin workflows

    actor Staff
    participant UI as Santashop Admin UI
    participant Auth as Firebase Auth
    participant Ctx as Context / Shared Services
    participant Fn as Cloud Functions
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant Stats as Stats Docs / Schedules

    Staff->>UI: Sign in
    UI->>Auth: signInWithEmailAndPassword

    Staff->>UI: Search by name/email/code
    UI->>Ctx: SearchService stores search query
    Ctx->>FS: query registrationsearchindex
    UI->>Ctx: ResultsPage unwraps and sorts results

    Staff->>UI: Scan QR code
    UI->>Ctx: LookupService.getRegistrationByQrCode$(code)
    Ctx->>FS: query registrations by qrcode
    Ctx-->>UI: set registration in CheckInContextService

    Staff->>UI: Review registration and check in
    alt Unedited check-in
        UI->>Fn: checkIn({ uid, qrcode, zipCode, children, hasCheckedIn })
        Fn->>FS: create checkins/{uid}
    else Edited check-in
        UI->>Fn: checkInWithEdit({ uid, qrcode, zipCode, children })
        Fn->>FS: create checkins/{uid}
        Fn->>FS: create editedregistrations/{uid}
    end

    Staff->>UI: Change date/time from review
    UI->>Fn: changeRegistrationDateTime({ newDateTimeSlot, registrationUid })
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: upsert tmp_registrationemails/{uid}

    Staff->>UI: Cancel reservation from review
    UI->>Fn: undoRegistration(registration)
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: delete registrationsearchindex/{uid}

    Staff->>UI: Create preregistration
    UI->>FS: query users by email for duplicate check
    UI->>Fn: callableAdminPreRegister(registration)
    Fn->>Auth: createUser(email, generated password)
    Fn->>FS: create users/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: create registrations/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: upsert registrationsearchindex/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: upsert tmp_registrationemails/{uid}

    Staff->>UI: Create on-site registration
    UI->>Fn: onSiteRegistration(registration)
    Fn->>FS: create onsiteregistrations/{id}
    Fn->>FS: create checkins/{id}

    Staff->>UI: Resend registration email
    UI->>FS: query registrationsearchindex by email
    UI->>Fn: callableResendRegistrationEmail({ customerId })
    Fn->>FS: upsert tmp_registrationemails/{uid}
    Fn->>FS: update registrations/{uid}.reminderEmail*

    Staff->>UI: Open stats pages
    UI->>FS: read stats/registration-{year}
    UI->>FS: read stats/schedule-{year}
    UI->>FS: read stats/checkin-{year}
    UI->>FS: read stats/user-{year}
    UI->>FS: query dateTimeSlots by programYear
    Stats-->>FS: scheduled jobs keep aggregate docs fresh
